tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI为ChatGPT上线实时听写功能并取消10分钟语音时长限制</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Google正式开放Genie4世界模型API，支持实时交互与原生音频生成</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌 Gemini 上线 Mac 电脑操控功能，支持后台自主执行多步骤任务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c3aa83de11d459b4254f89e7782879f3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月20日，谷歌正式为 macOS 版 Gemini 应用推出“电脑操控”（Computer Use）功能，支持 AI 跨越桌面应用、本地文件及网页环境自主执行复杂任务。该功能采用后台独立运行模式，不干扰用户主屏幕与鼠标操作，并提供实时预览与随时叫停机制。应用场景涵盖批量修图、PDF 数据提取、自动填写运费单及汇总数据制作 PPT 等。在安全性方面，Gemini 支持精细化权限管理，用户可限定访问范围并对关键操作进行二次确认。该功能已适配 macOS 27.3 系统，通过系统级提示明确 AI 代理的操作边界。目前，该功能仅面向美国地区的 Google AI Plus、Pro 与 Ultra 订阅用户开放，订阅起价为每月 4.99 美元，且硬件要求必须为搭载 Apple silicon 芯片的 Mac 机型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达第三季度营收翻倍至1158亿美元，股价却重挫创52周新低</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8ba88b9d91febbbc7bd322b257d80990.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达发布第三季度财报，营收同比翻倍达到1158亿美元，其中数据中心业务同比增长110%，Vera Rubin平台贡献了近200亿美元收入。尽管核心业务增长强劲，但英伟达股价表现与基本面严重背离，较10月6日历史高点重挫近40%，周四收于145.98美元，创下52周新低。此次股价剧烈调整受多重利空因素叠加影响，包括芯片板块整体抛售、前CEO黄仁勋辞职引发的管理层变动，以及公司治理调查带来的不确定性。市场在评估英伟达时，已将当期营收增速与公司内部治理风险及行业波动共同纳入考量，导致财报利好未能支撑股价走高。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">亏千亿也要敲钟：Anthropic 创纪录 IPO 背后的算力账单AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 20, 2026911 月 19 日，成立不到六年的 Anthropic 登陆纳斯达克（代码 ANT），募资约 813 亿美元，创史上最大 IPO 纪录。发行价 83 美元，首日收报 97.17 美元、涨 17.07%，市值约 1.28 万亿美元，盘中一度摸到 2 万亿。连同 260 亿美元私募，合计募得约 1073 亿美元。9000 亿算力承诺，压着 810 亿 ARR 招股书里更扎眼的是另一组数字：前九个月净亏损超 1040 亿美元，但其中 943 亿只是负债公允价值变动，并非实际支出，经营亏损实为 12.6 亿。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI为ChatGPT上线实时听写功能并取消10分钟语音时长限制</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4884ec035ee1189b4c1c1af2ae0d74e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式为ChatGPT引入“实时听写”功能，支持用户在语音输入的同时同步查看转写文字，并取消了原有的10分钟录音时长限制。该功能已覆盖网页版、桌面客户端及iOS和Android移动端，正陆续向全球用户推送。在交互体验上，用户点击输入框音频波形按钮即可启动，录音结束后支持直接在输入框内对转写文本进行修改与润色，显著提升了语音输入的即时性与可靠性。相比此前仅面向Plus、Enterprise等付费及工作区用户测试的“录制模式”，此次实时听写功能开放范围更广，旨在降低普通用户的语音交互门槛。此次更新通过优化语音转写流程，进一步强化了ChatGPT在日常办公与长文本口述场景下的实用性。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Google正式开放Genie4世界模型API，支持实时交互与原生音频生成</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/85a834d677cc386765934af65a4ee670.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Google于11月19日通过Gemini API与Google AI Studio正式向付费开发者开放Genie4世界模型（models/genie-4）。该模型依托Gemini Omni视觉渲染与Gemini推理能力，支持从文本或图像生成720p、24fps的连续高清交互世界，并同步输出原生立体声音频。用户可通过WASD键实时移动，响应延迟约0.5秒，并利用文本提示动态调整环境，系统延迟在1至2秒内。技术架构上，Genie4基于WebRTC与WebSocket进行流媒体传输，单次会话上限120秒，并嵌入SynthID水印。API定价为每百万输入令牌1.50美元，视频输出17.50美元，综合流媒体成本约每秒0.10美元。此次商业化落地不仅为交互式原型设计提供工具，也为机器人及AGI智能体提供了高保真的安全训练</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
